00:48:19,160 --> 00:48:25,970
you know my salary is out of line with the value that I added I want to make a significant adjustment not just a sort of boilerplate standard adjustment.

484
00:48:25,970 --> 00:48:35,330
so the the way that you know whether or not it's sort of negotiable in that particular window is is there budget for it.

