00:52:27,599 --> 00:52:32,370
it's pretty rare that that kind of thing is totally secret.

529
00:52:32,370 --> 00:52:36,870
and so in that conversation you can usually learn that from your manager if that's the case.

530
00:52:36,870 --> 00:52:44,339
now at the enterprise you're exactly right that I work dad we have an annual evaluation there was an annual time for a salary increase.

531
00:52:44,339 --> 00:52:50,160
and it was a salary pool so I took a piece of the pie.

532
00:52:50,160 --> 00:52:58,650
but I am hearing more and more and you mentioned this companies began small don't have this regular schedule of times to discuss it.

